OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after death of woman
OL,4,Ain her 60s
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder following the death of a woman
OL,8,Fin her 60s in South Gloucestershire.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to an
OL,11,Faddress in Overnhill Road, Downend,
OL,12,Fshortly after 1:45 BST on Sunday.
OL,14,FThe woman was found with serious
OL,15,Finjuries and was taken to hospital
OL,16,Fwhere she died a few hours later. The
OL,17,Fman, also on his 60s, was arrested
OL,18,Fshortly afterwards.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
