OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after death of woman
OL,4,Ain her 60s
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon & Somerset Police Superintendent
OL,7,FKaren Corrigan said the man was "in
OL,8,Fpolice custody where he is being
OL,9,Finterviewed under caution as we seek to
OL,10,Ffurther our understanding of the tragic
OL,11,Fevents that unfolded".
